<p>Hi<%= @creator.profile&.display_name.present? ? " #{@creator.profile.display_name}" : "" %>,</p>

<p>Your event <strong><%= @event.title %></strong> has been frozen by the Rally team and is no longer visible to the public.</p>

<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @reason %></p>

<p>This is different from unpublishing an event yourself — a freeze can only be reversed by the Rally team, so please don't attempt to publish, edit, or otherwise change this event in the meantime.</p>

<p>If you believe this decision was made in error, please reply to this email so we can look into it.</p>

<p>— The Rally team</p>
